# War Squeak {R}: Bot1 enchants its Grizzly Bears (+1/+1 and haste: 3/3, it may attack the turn it came in), and the enters trigger stops only a creature an opponent controls from blocking this turn (CR 509.1b,
# 611.2a): the only legal target is Bot2's Ornithopter, so Bot1 is asked nothing (its own Bears is not a candidate). Bot2's Ornithopter can't block the Bears this turn, so Bot2 takes 3; on Bot1's next turn the Ornithopter blocks it fine.

